%N A400707 A variant of Gijswijt's sequence A090822, starting with 1,2 instead of 1.
%C A400707 Start with S = [1,2] and extend S by appending its curling number; repeat.
%C A400707 Wenlin Zhang (Oct 03 2026) made the surprising discovery that (apparently) this sequence does not merge with Gijswijt's sequence. This has been checked for several million terms.
%C A400707 The first 4 in Gijswijt's sequence appears at term 220. In the present sequence, 4 first appears at term 727.
%D A400707 Wenlin Zhang, Email to N. J. A. Sloane, Oct 03 2026.
%H A400707 N. J. A. Sloane, <a href="/A400707/b400707.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..2000</a>
