%H A400707 Benjamin Chaffin, John P. Linderman, N. J. A. Sloane, and Allan R. Wilks, <a href="https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/journals/JIS/VOL16/Sloane/sloane3.html">On Curling Numbers of Integer Sequences</a>, Journal of Integer Sequences, Vol. 16 (2013), Article 13.4.3.
